          "settings": {
            "q": "How do I pick the right size?",
            "a": "<p>Use the size chart above, or our <a href=\"/pages/size-guide\">full size guide</a>. The size number is your bust in inches. Between two sizes? Pick the larger one, or WhatsApp us and we'll help.</p>"
